{"segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 1.86, "text": "is target your rich life."}, {"start": 3.34, "end": 4.64, "text": "And I have to say,"}, {"start": 4.74, "end": 7.16, "text": "I don't think buying a bunch of commodities"}, {"start": 8.8, "end": 11.1, "text": "can be a core part of your rich life."}, {"start": 11.2, "end": 12.66, "text": "In fact, I've never heard somebody say"}, {"start": 12.66, "end": 13.88, "text": "target is my rich life."}, {"start": 14.64, "end": 15.3, "text": "It's just not."}, {"start": 15.98, "end": 16.88, "text": "Spending time with your kids,"}, {"start": 17.78, "end": 19.58, "text": "being able to volunteer with them,"}, {"start": 20.34, "end": 22.48, "text": "buying something beautiful that you appreciate,"}, {"start": 22.58, "end": 23.98, "text": "even going out and splurging for a meal"}, {"start": 23.98, "end": 25.12, "text": "and getting an extra appetizer."}, {"start": 25.3, "end": 26.8, "text": "Yes, that can be part of a rich life."}, {"start": 26.88, "end": 27.94, "text": "A lot of people have told me that."}, {"start": 28.33, "end": 31.24, "text": "But buying some stuff at a random store,"}, {"start": 32.38, "end": 33.02, "text": "probably not."}], "words": [{"w": "is", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.22}, {"w": "target", "start": 0.22, "end": 0.74}, {"w": "your", "start": 0.74, "end": 1.04}, {"w": "rich", "start": 1.04, "end": 1.34}, {"w": "life.", "start": 1.34, "end": 1.86}, {"w": "And", "start": 3.34, "end": 3.76}, {"w": "I", "start": 3.76, "end": 4.18}, {"w": "have", "start": 4.18, "end": 4.32}, {"w": "to", "start": 4.32, "end": 4.44}, {"w": "say,", "start": 4.44, "end": 4.64}, {"w": "I", "start": 4.74, "end": 4.9}, {"w": "don't", "start": 4.9, "end": 5.28}, {"w": "think", "start": 5.28, "end": 5.5}, {"w": "buying", "start": 5.5, "end": 5.88}, {"w": "a", "start": 5.88, "end": 6.1}, {"w": "bunch", "start": 6.1, "end": 6.28}, {"w": "of", "start": 6.28, "end": 6.48}, {"w": "commodities", "start": 6.48, "end": 7.16}, {"w": "can", "sta